4Introduction to JQuery 
▪The Purpose of JQuery is to make it easier to use 
JavaScript on your website. 
▪JQuery is a JavaScript library. 
▪JQuery Greatly Simplifies JavaScript Programming. 
▪JQuery is easy to learn. 
▪JQuery is lightweight open source “write less,do 
more” Javascript on your website. 
▪JQuery simplifies the interaction between HTML/CSS 
page and JavaScript.  
▪Jquery is Developed by Google 

