5Why jQuery Required 
▪It is fast and extensive. 
▪It facilitates the users to write UI related 
function code in minimum possible lines 
▪It improves the performance of an application 
▪Browser’s compatible web application can be 
developed 
▪It uses mostly new feature of new browser 
Important: 
There are several ways to start using jQuery on 
your web site. You can: 
•Download the jQuery library from jQuery.com 
•Include jQuery from a CDN, like Google 


