10JQuery Selector 
▪JQuery selectors are used to select or find an HTML 
element ,that allow to manipulate HTML element. 
▪Element can be selected based on 
•ID
•Class 
•Element 
•Attributes 
•Value of Attribute and Many more.. 

--- Page 11 ---
09-03-2025 
Mukti Patel, Dept. of Computer Sc. & 
Engineering 
11#Id Selector 
▪jQuery id selector use id attribute  of an HTML tag to select an 
element 
▪# symbol followed by element id used to find an element. 
▪Element id should be unique to find an unique element. 
▪Id selector use document.getElementByID() method behind the 
scene. 
▪If more than one id is present with same name than only first 
occurring will be consider. 
•$(“#para1”).hide() 
•$(“#heading1”).fadeout() 

--- Page 12 ---
09-03-2025 
Mukti Patel, Dept. of Computer Sc. & 
Engineering 
12Class Selector 
▪JQuery class selector use class attribute of an HTML 
tag to select an element. 
▪.(period) symbol followed by class name is used to 
find an element 
▪Element class should be unique to find unique 
element 
▪Class selector use 
•document.getElementByClassName() method behind the 
scene. 
Example: 
$(“.div1”).hide() 


