13Some Other Selector 
▪$(“*”)- Select all the elements 
▪$(“this”)-Select Current Element 
▪$(“p.para1”)-Select all the ‘p’ element with ‘para1’ 
▪$(“p.first”)-Select all  the first ‘p’ element. 
▪Element Selector 
▪jQuery Element selector element based on the 
element name. 
▪Example: 
•$(“p”)-Select all ‘p’ elements on the page 
•$(“button”)- Select all button on the page 


