event types which you can bind using jQuery 
Sr.N
o.Event Type & Description 
1blur Occurs when the element loses focus. 
2change Occurs when the element changes. 
3click Occurs when a mouse click. 
4dblclick Occurs when a mouse double-click. 
5error Occurs when there is an error in loading or unloading etc. 
6focus Occurs when the element gets focus. 

